<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 595.17, down 2.14.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 313 to 224.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.06.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,999,410 compared with 20,243,010 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
